<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 4th Amsterdam-Asia/MEast Air Cargo Report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th Amsterdam-Asia/MEast Air Cargo Report.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   July 15		    May 28</p>
<p>			 ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>AMS-HKG	   3.15			 2.95</p>
<p>AMS-SIN	   2.70			 2.60</p>
<p>AMS-TYO	   5.00			 4.50</p>
<p>AMS-TPE	   2.60			 2.55</p>
<p>AMS-SEL	   4.15			 4.10</p>
<p>AMS-KUL	   2.60			 2.55</p>
<p>	  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>AMS-DXB	   1.70			 1.75</p>
<p>AMS-BAH	   2.60			 2.60</p>
<p>AMS-MCT	   2.80			 2.85</p>
<p>AMS-AUH	   2.50			 2.45</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdan Schiphol airport.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
</text>
